    "created_at": "2016-08-30T22:11:46Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-08-30T22:11:46Z",
    "body": "Done. Setting `data-dfn-lt=\"\"` _should_ drop it from Bikeshed's database, so nothing can autolink to it at all.  (If this works as it should, we can use it for all the other things that were \"unexported\" just to try and hide them from Bikeshed.)\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
